Modifications: the following files were adapted from codex-plugin-cc and
changed to drive Google's Antigravity CLI (agy) instead of Codex.

- plugins/agy/commands/*.md, from plugins/codex/commands/*.md: rewritten for
  agy jobs; added plan and approve commands; removed transfer.
- plugins/agy/agents/agy-rescue.md, from plugins/codex/agents/codex-rescue.md:
  rewritten for the agy runtime.
- plugins/agy/skills/agy-cli-runtime, agy-result-handling and
  gemini-prompting, from plugins/codex/skills/codex-cli-runtime,
  codex-result-handling and gpt-5-4-prompting: rewritten for agy and Gemini;
  result handling adds verification of quotes and file:line claims.
- plugins/agy/prompts/adversarial-review.md, from
  plugins/codex/prompts/adversarial-review.md: reworded for Gemini.
- plugins/agy/schemas/review-output.schema.json: copied unchanged.
- plugins/agy/scripts/: a Python reimplementation of the job state, job
  tracking, git review-context and rendering ideas in
  plugins/codex/scripts/lib/{state,tracked-jobs,job-control,render,git,workspace}.mjs.
  The app-server, broker and session-transfer code was not carried over.

